#: ../src/actions/actions-object-align.cpp:837
msgid ""
"Enter arrange method. Possible values: graph, exchange, exchangez, rotate, "
"randomize, unclump."
msgstr ""
"Ange ordningsmetod. Möjliga värden: graph, exchange, exchangez, rotate, "
"randomize, unclump."
#: ../src/actions/actions-object.cpp:528
msgid ""
"Apply clipping path to selection (using the topmost object as clipping path)"
msgstr ""
"Tillämpa klippbana på markeringen (genom att använda det översta objektet "
"som klippbana)"
#: ../src/actions/actions-object.cpp:531
msgid ""
"Create a self-clipping group to which objects (not contributing to the clip-"
"path) can be added"
msgstr ""
"Skapa en självklippande grupp till vilken objekt som inte bidrar till "
"klippbanan kan läggas till"
